sequenceDiagram
    %% SD6 - Look back and re-estimate
    %% Stories: 13, 35, 39
    %% Description: A participant scrolls back through earlier rounds. The moderator reopens an earlier item, and participants see each estimator's prior estimates.
    actor PT as Participant
    actor M as Moderator
    participant G as Game
    participant R as Round
    participant I as Item
    participant ES as Estimate
    participant E as Estimator

    %% covers 39
    PT->>G: view earlier rounds
    G->>R: earlier rounds
    %% covers 13
    M->>R: select an earlier item again
    R->>I: earlier item
    %% covers 35
    PT->>I: see prior estimates per estimator
    I->>ES: prior estimates
    ES->>E: estimator
